  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n75% of x is 15 less than 15% of 1500.\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n75% of x = 15% of 1500 - 15\n\n0.75x = 0.15 × 1500 - 15\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n0.15 × 1500 = 225\n\n0.75x = 225 - 15\n\n0.75x = 210\n\n⇒ x = 210 / 0.75\n\n⇒ x = 280\n\n**The value of x is 280.**",
